OL,3,AAdventurer completes 400-mile
OL,4,Aexpedition after losing contact with
OL,5,Ateam
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn adventurer has completed the first
OL,8,Fleg of his latest challenge after
OL,9,Flosing contact with his UK team for
OL,10,Falmost 24 hours.
OL,12,FAsh Dykes, 35, from Old Colwyn, Conwy,
OL,13,Fholds five world records but his most
OL,14,Frecent quest was the first of six
OL,15,Fback-to-back expeditions he will take
OL,16,Fon in extreme environments.
OL,18,FDykes encountered elephants, gorillas
OL,19,Fand was chased by "killer" bees as he
OL,20,Frowed more than 434 miles (700 km)
OL,21,Falong rivers in the Congo Basin,
OL,22,Fcentral Africa.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
