OL,3,AAdventurer completes 400-mile
OL,4,Aexpedition after losing contact with
OL,5,Ateam
OL,6,
OL,7,FTowards the end of the journey, Dykes'
OL,8,Fportable satellite kit lost power. He
OL,9,Fsaid: "My parents and fiancee were
OL,10,Fworrying but as soon as I had a bit of
OL,11,Fsignal I made sure I got in touch".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
